      "title": "6.contour_fill",
      "properties": {
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "\"contour_fill\" determines whether to fill the inside of masks with empty spaces, such as a donut. \n\nIf contour_fill is disabled, the original mask is used as is in SEGS. \n\nIf contour_fill is enabled, the interior is filled based on the borders of separate masks."
      ],
